# ============================================================
# Ignore everything except my assigned work.
#
# The full XAMPP project stays on disk so the app still runs.
# Only schema / data-dictionary artifacts are tracked and
# pushed for teammates B and C to build against.
#
# Pattern notes:
#   - Use /* (not *) so Git only ignores root-level entries.
#     A bare * would also ignore files inside folders we
#     un-ignore below, including nested subdirectories.
#   - Un-ignoring a folder (e.g. !/sql/) is enough for Git
#     to track that folder's files AND its subdirectories.
# ============================================================

# Ignore every file and folder at the repository root
/*

# Always keep this file
!.gitignore

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Schema (sql/schema.sql and any nested SQL docs)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
!/sql/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Data dictionary summary + documented table/column names
# for B and C. Track docs/ (including nested subfolders)
# and common dictionary filenames if they live at repo root.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
!/docs/
!/DATA_DICTIONARY.md
!/data_dictionary.md
!/data-dictionary.md
!/data_dictionary.txt
!/DATA_DICTIONARY.txt
!/data_dictionary.sql
!/tables.md
!/TABLES.md
!/schema.md
!/schema.sql
